"test":{"name":"script-save","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptSave","question":"Saving a game with its triggers part way (ScenarioScript.ToJson with progress, as LevelEditor.BoardJson writes it, and Load): a kill counted toward Two kills, a trigger fired, a marker shown, a line on screen with its trigger's next action waiting on it, the level clock — all come back; the conversation is shown again, and closing it lets the waiting action run. The scenario as authored (no progress) is what the file keeps; conditions are saved by number (Units In Area is 6).","rules":"standard"},
